WEBVTT

00:19:56.663 --> 00:20:00.288
and hopefully we can all agree on.
But do you want the AI to like.

00:20:01.413 --> 00:20:04.038
You know, support you and your belief
of intelligent design, like,

00:20:04.121 --> 00:20:05.954
do I think openly, I should say it can't,

00:20:06.454 --> 00:20:09.538
even though I disagree with that is
like a scientific conclusion.

00:20:09.538 --> 00:20:11.371
No, I wouldn't take that stance.

00:20:12.121 --> 00:20:17.163
I think the thing to remember about all
of this is that history is still quite

00:20:17.496 --> 00:20:22.829
extraordinarily weak. It's still has
such big problems and it's still

00:20:22.829 --> 00:20:27.163
so unreliable that for most use
cases it's still unsuitable.

00:20:27.704 --> 00:20:31.163
But when we think about a system that is
like a thousand times more powerful